<PublicLayout title="ClearCut Documentation & Architecture">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 prose dark:prose-invert">
    <h1>ClearCut Architecture & Governance</h1>
    <p>ClearCut is built with Google ADK / Gemini for candidate detection and Parallel Search/Extract for source-backed evidence gathering.</p>
    <h2>Core Tenets</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Mandatory Parallel Search:</strong> The web research path always begins with real Parallel Search.</li>
      <li><strong>Provenance Mandatory:</strong> Every claim cites an immutable snapshot with a SHA-256 hash.</li>
      <li><strong>Human Governance:</strong> AI models never make binding legal conclusions or clearance decisions.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</PublicLayout>
